  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of Critical Shelter and Non-Food Items Assistance to Displaced Populations in Yemen-2021</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide safe, secure and dignified shelter solutions and non-food items (NFI) to populations affected by the conflict in Yemen. The project targets vulnerable host communities across the country, specifically in Al Hodeidah and Ta&#x2019;iz, where initial assessments have shown that vulnerable host community members are also in need of shelter and NFI assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
